{"server":"cn","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_04_end","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_04","title":"家传金拖鞋","storyCode":"AS-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"f14325acdb997a399f76f41da78da484ff458cde642cf047f5b36f938b2f09e4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"宣布比赛结果时，因为得到一等奖的人主动弃权，所以佩佩与阿斯帕齐娅都没能获得想要的奖品。从阿斯帕齐娅那里得到宝石的娜仁图亚决定借此吸引佩佩上钩，但阴差阳错下，宝石却来到梅捷缇克缇手中。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g4_ctizengarden"},{"type":"narration","text":"♪河岸上摇曳着纸莎草，河面倒映着青金石♪\n♪流过黄金沙丘的长河啊，因宝石的供奉永不干涸♪\n♪愿我得见祂漫步河畔，愿我随祂的脚步走向永恒♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g4_ctizengarden"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴随着热烈的掌声与激昂的合唱，沿着璀璨的宝石大道，获奖者们机械地往前走着。\n承载了历史厚重感的莎草船缓缓下沉。黄金拖鞋，来自米诺斯的十枚银牌，都变成了水面上的一串气泡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉沙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗憾？不，我怎么可能有遗憾呢？见到哈特谢普苏特女士才是我这次参赛最重要的收获！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉沙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比之下，集会名次又有什么值得在意的呢？......不过，当然，我认为一张失去冠军的人和冠军的合影会很有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉沙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尊敬的哈特谢普苏特女士，不知道您是否愿意赏脸与我合影？如果您愿意展示第一名获得的雕像，那就再好不过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，当然......谢谢您......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我参加了一场荒唐的竞赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，一场荒唐的竞赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的本意，是对历史的求索，对英雄伟业的尊敬，对胜利孜孜不倦的追求，以及，对命运的诘问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，对命运的......什么来着。总之，你的十枚银牌变成了一枚新的银牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但别太难过，这里可是萨尔贡，所以，这还不算失败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“地上的黄沙，地下的黄金。”王酋帕夏一句话，沙子就能变得跟金子一样珍贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才的损失不用放在心上，只要哪天机遇来了，你得到了认可，说不定金杯就会白送给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白送？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说，去和拿到金杯的人聊聊，骗他信任你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你说得很对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拿出的宝物得到了认可。这也代表着，米诺斯的文化得到了认可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕裁判席给出的评价十分浅薄，这些银牌得到的分数和名次本身足以证明，专业的萨尔贡历史学者对米诺斯有基本的尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该跟拿到金杯的收藏家好好谈谈。他如果也能理解物品背后那段沉重的历史，或许会愿意以一个我负担得起的价格转手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的认可了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，如果这样也算还上了你的人情，那也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真心感谢，娜仁图亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如那些在白墙下辩论的智者，你点醒了我。我不会失去那些银牌所代表的荣誉，而且现在我获得了更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比之下，命运如何捉弄我本人，不值得我在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果把那些银牌扔进水中，能帮助人们见到自己想见的影子，那我十分乐意效劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果把手里的这颗宝石扔进水中，也能请来人们口中神灵的影子，那我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看出来你心情变好了，但是冷静一点，别扔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有个想法......或者说，我现在就有一个想见的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这颗宝石你不太在乎，能不能......借我一用？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陷阱已经布置好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我活儿干得很仔细。越是懂行的人越不可能起疑心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邀约信也悄悄放在那个女孩的包里了。我戴了搬运文物用的手套，肯定不会留下痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后面的事情我来安排。你们对这次计划还有什么疑问吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。我不明白，我们的诱饵为什么能钓到帕夏之女？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这颗宝石看起来也没什么特别的，就像我和阿雅妮那天从下水道里捞起来的石头一样有很多杂质......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有钱人的爱好嘛，不用深究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚你们在门口盯着，别眨眼睛，不要让她派人来提前拿走宝石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅吉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好......我们这次一定不让你失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雅妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我们绝对不会把任何一个人放进来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"灵巧地避过房间内设下的重重陷阱，米奥来到桌前。\n它亮闪闪的瞳孔中，倒映出桌上璀璨的宝石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deluxeroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一封匿名信，一张模糊的宝石照片，信中写了时间地点并要求你独自前往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"显而易见，这是一个圈套，你不应该赴约，佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然要去，不然要怎么将宝石拿到手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你答应了今晚带我去城中的人造湖泊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应了吗？或许是你记错了，有没有可能是明晚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换了个脑子后，我从来不会记错事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你说的，那几颗宝石的位置你就记得不是很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以找阿娜特，她最近为你的事写了很多公文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实还有一些关于这位古代将领的观察笔记和几段论文草稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定她愿意带你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或者我还需要再加几天班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这封信是谁寄来的，你真的没有头绪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个拿了第二名的游客看起来是个好人呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，也有可能我在参加丰获集会时真的表现得太明显了，人人都能看出我想要的是那块宝石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但只有拿到宝石才能从祖拜尔那里问出更多信息，无论是我要寻找的宝藏，还是你撰写论文所需要的材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是这样，我也不建议你冒险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，即使现在的我已经走遍了萨尔贡也不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我记得光是在上学的时候，你就有两次差点回不来了，幸好我和缇缇去找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你们就为了让我评判谁对历史文献的解读更有可信度，专门雇了一支驮兽冒险队去沙漠里找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是缇缇在这里，我说不好就有支持者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好她不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对啊？这么说来，缇缇去哪里了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g2_menatmainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“惹麻烦”......说得就像我想坏她的事一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，文书我也帮她看过一遍了，她应该不会压力太大在办公室里昏倒吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！什、什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是我可爱的宝石构装体，就乖乖地走出来，不要吓唬我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我数到三，你再不出来，我就要用源石技艺了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一，二......三！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵——！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，糟了......！怎么又是这只小云兽！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，小家伙，原谅我......哎，摸摸毛，摸摸毛，不要生气......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你脾气不好爱挠人，但你听我解释，我今天这么神经质是有原因的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得吗？之前我们一起待在博物馆的时候，我就被各种莫名其妙动起来的东西吓坏了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......然后，今天我又和阿娜特吵起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托了，可爱的小云兽，你可千万不要像那家伙一样对我生气哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（发出呼噜声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我们总是起争执，当然，是为学术上的问题争执。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道她真的很想向公众展示自己的研究成果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也知道这次举办特展的机会来之不易，所以她非常谨慎，还有点紧张过头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许紧张到最后，连自己的初衷都不敢坚持了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明明是想让她不要放弃特展啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"梅捷缇克缇无意识加快了抚摸的速度。\n而米奥因此发出了更加响亮的呼噜声。\n但女孩浑然不觉，只是陷入自己的思绪，抚摸小云兽的动作也越来越快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前......她说话时声音小小的，一旦紧张，身体动作就会变得很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次她在公众面前讲话，最后大家都会在下面偷笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，就算声音都被笑声盖住了，她还是会站在那里，坚持讲完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，真希望她坚持其他事情的勇气也能来得这么简单，只要这样揉揉她的耳朵就行。"},{"type":"narration","text":"梅捷缇克缇双手包住小云兽的脸用力揉搓，发泄着自己的情绪，丝毫没有兴趣分辨小云兽的呼噜声是什么意思。\n突然，她感觉手心一热。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，你在吐毛球？！别吐到我的袖子上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一颗宝石？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deluxeroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，我一个人去对方指定的地点，在衣服里藏好监听器，再找私人警卫埋伏在附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间太紧急了，佩佩。现在可是漫灌节前夕，安保公司很难抽调出空闲的人力，我们也不能半夜三更跟人谈判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你们租一架飞行器随时准备接应我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些能飞的东西会让人起疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走到门口，挥起一锤直接把大门砸开，把对方吓住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒是有可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是那样算不算损坏历史建筑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，确实有那么一点嫌疑，虽然和你的年代比起来不算历史......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我很喜欢，在我之后的人们生活的痕迹——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好呀——诸位——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？佩佩也在？太巧啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们猜我刚刚在路上遇到什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缇缇，你来得正好！我们在商量很重要的事，我需要你的支持......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，快帮我劝劝佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是发掘重要历史遗迹的机会，换了你们，难道会为了自己的人身安全就放弃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该比我们都清楚，发掘工作最需要的是耐心！现在你只是想追上你弟弟，这简直是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，阿娜特，为什么这次见面，你变得这么严厉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，没人想猜猜看我遇上什么事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的衣服上沾了很多毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢捧场，祖拜尔先生。你猜对啦，我遇到了一只小云兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的时代，人们相信云兽会带来好运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我也相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——它给我吐了一块幸运的宝石哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托，让我看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从阿娜特那里听说，她把博物馆收藏的那一颗宝石借给了你，所以你同意了给新展馆投资。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂我懂，我会以你的名义追加投资。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你......不，希望你们答应我一件别的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩佩，阿娜特，还有......祖拜尔先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得这颗宝石能让我们都遂愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
